<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:29:09 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>GTA VI 第一天的收入估计为 23.6 亿美元。现在 1,600 名 Rockstar 员工正在投票组建工会</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/rockstar-games-union-vote-gta-vi/</link><description>在裁员担忧、破坏工会的法庭和人工智能的背景下，英国超过 1,600 名 Rockstar 员工将在 11 月 26 日之前投票决定承认 IWGB 支持的工会。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2299743476.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:02:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/rockstar-games-union-vote-gta-vi/</guid></item><item><title>“一半慈善，一半抗议”：Noah Wyle 和 Figs 联手消除真实患者 2 亿美元的医疗债务</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/half-philanthropy-and-half-protest-noah-wyle-and-figs-pair-up-to-erase-200-million-in-real-patients-medical-debt/</link><description>在电视上扮演医生几十年后，怀尔与 Figs 和 Undue Medical Debt 合作，为超过 150,000 名美国人清除债务。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2276901465-e1795120613418.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 08:04:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/half-philanthropy-and-half-protest-noah-wyle-and-figs-pair-up-to-erase-200-million-in-real-patients-medical-debt/</guid></item><item><title>近 15% 的美国人预计明年物价将上涨 15% 或更多，这是美国 79 年来从未见过的涨幅</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/consumers-expect-inflation-over-15-percent-1979-oil-shock-ubs-donovan/</link><description>瑞银集团(UBS)的保罗·多诺万(Paul Donovan)表示，近15%的消费者预计明年物价将上涨15%以上，甚至比1979年的涨幅还要快。一般家庭的预期为3.7%。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2295761544-e1792156924168.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 18:35:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/consumers-expect-inflation-over-15-percent-1979-oil-shock-ubs-donovan/</guid></item><item><title>“这可能太艰难了”：特朗普在中期选举后重新审视了他的移民镇压政策。然后他的劳工部加倍努力</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/trump-immigration-crackdown-midterms-labor-department/</link><description>特朗普坚称，“我认为我因关闭边境而获得了A+”，而他的劳工部则提出了自2005年以来最严厉的移民新条款。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305643148-e1795197420764.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 18:33:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/trump-immigration-crackdown-midterms-labor-department/</guid></item><item><title>Anthropic 的股价目前仅比 IPO 价格高出 15 美分，与首日股价的惊人逆转</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/anthropic-stock-teeters-close-to-ipo-price-in-second-day-of-trading/</link><description>在回吐了首日的大部分涨幅后，AI 实验室的股价周五跌至 83.15 美元，仅比 83 美元的 IPO 价格高出几美分。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305413796-e1795195810143.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 16:44:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/anthropic-stock-teeters-close-to-ipo-price-in-second-day-of-trading/</guid></item><item><title>X世代的2.3万亿美元护理诅咒：我是约翰·穆拉尼（John Mulaney）SNL短剧中的妹妹，我做了数学计算</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/snl-sister-sketch-caregiving-cost-millennials/</link><description>在过去的 14 年里（以及过去的几年），我一直是我父母的全职看护者，没有报酬。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2304769832.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 18:05:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/snl-sister-sketch-caregiving-cost-millennials/</guid></item><item><title>侠盗猎车手使犯罪成为一种游戏。人工智能正在为黑客做同样的事情</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/grand-theft-auto-vi-ai-hacking-artex-cybersecurity/</link><description>攻击者现在以三小时制运行&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2303444770.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/grand-theft-auto-vi-ai-hacking-artex-cybersecurity/</guid></item><item><title>《周六夜现场》(SNL) 的热门“姐姐”小品质疑，当女儿免费照顾老人时，为什么还要付费——一名家庭保健助理每月的收入约为 6,688 美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/snl-sister-sketch-elder-care-cost-caregivers/</link><description>哈佛大学 2025 年的一项研究发现，76% 的 75 岁及以上家庭无法负担家庭健康助理的日常帮助。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2304769881.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:56:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/snl-sister-sketch-elder-care-cost-caregivers/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普、普京和习近平在 90 分钟的会谈中签署了 1985 年的里根-戈尔巴乔夫核线路——乌克兰甚至没有提到名字</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/trump-putin-xi-shenzhen-summit-nuclear-ukraine/</link><description>三位领导人没有讨论人工智能监管和关键矿产供应链等中美经济竞争中的关键问题。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2305165048-e1794999320790.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:55:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/trump-putin-xi-shenzhen-summit-nuclear-ukraine/</guid></item><item><title>十年间，数据中心占俄勒冈州用电量的比例从约 3% 增至约 23%，并占 2020 年以来售电量增长的 96%</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/data-centers-electricity-use-oregon-virginia-states/</link><description>哈佛大学主导的一项研究估计，美国 403 个数据中心每年的用电量约为 82 太瓦时，相当于近 800 万个家庭的用电量。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-2278507670-e1782738351812.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:54:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/20/data-centers-electricity-use-oregon-virginia-states/</guid></item></channel></rss>